@startuml 顺序图-UC06-审批预约申请
title 顺序图 · UC-06 审批预约申请
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 170
autonumber
hide footbox

actor "教室管理员" as Admin
participant "预约审批界面" as UI
participant "审批控制器\n(应用服务)" as Controller
participant "预约规则校验器\nReservationPolicy" as Policy
participant "预约仓储" as Repo
database "数据库" as DB
participant "通知服务\n(Outbox)" as Notify

Admin -> UI: 打开待办并选择预约
UI -> Controller: GET /admin/approvals/{reservationId}
Controller -> Repo: findApprovalDetail(id)
Repo -> DB: 查询预约、课表、材料、信用、审批日志
DB --> Repo: detail + version
Repo --> Controller: ApprovalDetail
Controller --> UI: 200 OK\n详情 + version
UI --> Admin: 展示冲突、材料与历史

Admin -> UI: 选择通过 / 驳回 / 调整 / 退回
UI -> Controller: POST decisions\nIf-Match: version + Idempotency-Key
Controller -> Repo: lockAndLoad(reservationId)
Repo -> DB: BEGIN + SELECT ... FOR UPDATE
DB --> Repo: currentReservation
Repo --> Controller: currentReservation

alt 版本不一致
  Controller --> UI: 409 VERSION_CONFLICT
  UI --> Admin: 刷新详情后重试
else 版本匹配
  alt 调整教室或时段后通过
    Controller -> Policy: validate(adjustedResource)
    Policy -> Repo: findActiveOverlaps(newResource)
    Repo -> DB: 查询新资源占用
    DB --> Repo: conflict / no conflict
    Repo --> Policy: 校验结果
    Policy --> Controller: ValidationResult
    alt 新资源冲突
      Controller -> DB: ROLLBACK
      Controller --> UI: 409 RESERVATION_CONFLICT
      UI --> Admin: 原申请仍在待审批队列
    else 新资源可用
      Controller -> Controller: 使用新资源
      Controller -> Controller: ADJUST_AND_APPROVE → ACTIVE\n生成签到凭证
      Controller -> Repo: saveDecision(status, approvalLog, outbox)
      Repo -> DB: UPDATE reservation\nINSERT approval_log\nINSERT notification_outbox\nCOMMIT
      DB --> Repo: committed
      Repo --> Controller: updated + newVersion
      Controller --> UI: 200 OK\nresult + newVersion
      UI --> Admin: 更新待办
    end
  else 直接通过 / 驳回 / 退回
    alt 决定 = REJECT / RETURN_FOR_SUPPLEMENT
      Controller -> Controller: REJECT → REJECTED\nRETURN → PENDING_SUPPLEMENT
    else 决定 = APPROVE
      Controller -> Controller: 复核冲突后 → ACTIVE\n生成签到凭证
    end
    Controller -> Repo: saveDecision(status, approvalLog, outbox)
    Repo -> DB: UPDATE reservation\nINSERT approval_log\nINSERT notification_outbox\nCOMMIT
    DB --> Repo: committed
    Repo --> Controller: updated + newVersion
    Controller --> UI: 200 OK\nresult + newVersion
    UI --> Admin: 更新待办
  end

  Note over Notify, DB: 提交后投递审批结果通知；\n外部通知失败不回滚审批
end
@enduml
